{"nodes": [{"id": "_claude_skills_figma_to_code_skill_figma_to_code", "label": "Skill /figma-to-code", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".claude/skills/figma-to-code/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Un dise\u00f1o de Figma no es una imagen a copiar a ojo: es un sistema de tokens y jerarqu\u00edas, y traducirlo pixel a pixel produce CSS fr\u00e1gil."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_figma_to_code_skill_design_tokens", "label": "Tokens de dise\u00f1o por rol", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/figma-to-code/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Los colores se nombran por rol (--color-surface) y no por valor (--blue-1); dos elementos que difieren en 1 unidad de hex son probablemente un error de dise\u00f1o a reportar, no dos tokens."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_figma_to_code_skill_spacing_scale_rounding", "label": "Redondeo a la escala de 4/8", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/figma-to-code/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Un 13px donde el sistema espera 12 o 16 es desviaci\u00f3n de precisi\u00f3n de la herramienta, no una decisi\u00f3n: se redondea al valor de la escala."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_figma_to_code_skill_autolayout_mapping", "label": "Auto-layout de Figma a flex/grid real", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/figma-to-code/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Gap \u2192 display:flex + gap (nunca m\u00e1rgenes manuales entre hijos); hug \u2192 fit-content; fill \u2192 flex:1; wrap bidimensional \u2192 grid, no flex forzado."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_figma_to_code_skill_component_hierarchy", "label": "Jerarqu\u00eda de componentes vs maquetaci\u00f3n \u00fanica", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/figma-to-code/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Lo que se repite con variantes se construye como componente; una secci\u00f3n que aparece una sola vez se maqueta directo, sin sobre-abstraer."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_figma_to_code_skill_inferred_states", "label": "Estados no dibujados en el dise\u00f1o", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/figma-to-code/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Hover, focus, disabled, loading y error rara vez vienen dibujados: se infiere el patr\u00f3n del propio design system donde S\u00cd est\u00e1 y se aplica consistentemente, declarando en el reporte qu\u00e9 se infiri\u00f3."}], "edges": [{"source": "_claude_skills_figma_to_code_skill_figma_to_code", "target": "_claude_skills_figma_to_code_skill_design_tokens", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/figma-to-code/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_claude_skills_figma_to_code_skill_figma_to_code", "target": "_claude_skills_figma_to_code_skill_spacing_scale_rounding", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/figma-to-code/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_claude_skills_figma_to_code_skill_figma_to_code", "target": "_claude_skills_figma_to_code_skill_autolayout_mapping", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/figma-to-code/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_claude_skills_figma_to_code_skill_figma_to_code", "target": "_claude_skills_figma_to_code_skill_component_hierarchy", "relation": "references", "c